"path": "quillsync > Configuration", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u5", "text": "| `folder` | `~/notes` | Local folder to synchronise |\n", "tokens": [91, 1595, 18135, 63, 765, 1595, 23549, 18790, 63, 765, 8949, 8695, 311, 14453, 1082, 9432], "positions": [153, 154, 155, 156, 157, 158, 159, 160, 161, 162, 163, 164, 165, 166, 167, 168], "seq_ids": [2], "token_class": "MMCMMMCCMMCCCCCM"}, {"id": "n18", "node_type": "table_row", "parent": "n14", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "quillsync > Configuration", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u5", "text": "| `interval` | `300` | Seconds between automatic syncs |\n", "tokens": [91, 1595, 29004, 63, 765, 1595, 3101, 63, 765, 62083, 1990, 17392, 13105, 82, 9432], "positions": [169, 170, 171, 172, 173, 174, 175, 176, 177, 178, 179, 180, 181, 182, 183], "seq_ids": [2], "token_class": "MMCMMMCMMCCCCCM"}, {"id": "n19", "node_type": "table_row", "parent": "n14", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "quillsync > Configuration", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u5", "text": "| `conflict_policy` | `keep-both` | What to do when both sides changed |\n\n", "tokens": [91, 1595, 6263, 21937, 23613, 63, 765, 1595, 13397, 12, 21704, 63, 765, 3639, 311, 656, 994, 2225, 11314, 5614, 36821], "positions": [184, 185, 186, 187, 188, 189, 190, 191, 192, 193, 194, 195, 196, 197, 198, 199, 200, 201, 202, 203, 204], "seq_ids": [2], "token_class": "MMCCCMMMCCCMMCCCCCCCM"}, {"id": "n20", "node_type": "heading", "parent": "n1", "children": ["n21", "n23", "n25"], "depth": 2, "title": "Commands", "path": "quillsync > Commands", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "unit": "u6", "text": "## Commands\n\n", "tokens": [567, 48283, 271], "positions": [76, 77, 78], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "MCW"}, {"id": "n21", "node_type": "heading", "parent": "n20", "children": ["n22"], "depth": 3, "title": "sync", "path": "quillsync > Commands > sync", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "unit": "u7", "text": "### sync\n\n", "tokens": [14711, 13105, 271], "positions": [79, 80, 81], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "MCW"}, {"id": "n22", "node_type": "paragraph", "parent": "n21", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "quillsync > Commands > sync", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u7", "text": "Runs one synchronisation immediately. With `--dry-run` it prints the planned uploads and\ndownloads without touching any file.\n\n", "tokens": [75020, 832, 14453, 8082, 7214, 13, 3161, 1595, 313, 54310, 23831, 63, 433, 24370, 279, 13205, 67663, 323, 198, 82429, 2085, 31687, 904, 1052, 382], "positions": [82, 83, 84, 85, 86, 87, 88, 89, 90, 91, 92, 93, 94, 95, 96, 97, 98, 99, 100, 101, 102, 103, 104, 105, 106], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "CCCCCCCMCCCMCCCCCCWCCCCCC"}, {"id": "n23", "node_type": "heading", "parent": "n20", "children": ["n24"], "depth": 3, "title": "status", "path": "quillsync > Commands > status", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "unit": "u7", "text": "### status\n\n", "tokens": [14711, 2704, 271], "positions": [107, 108, 109], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "MCW"}, {"id": "n24", "node_type": "paragraph", "parent": "n23", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "quillsync > Commands > status", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u7", "text": "Shows the last successful sync time, the number of pending changes, and whether the\nserver is reachable.\n\n", "tokens": [76175, 279, 1566, 6992, 13105, 892, 11, 279, 1396, 315, 15639, 4442, 11, 323, 3508, 279, 198, 4120, 374, 69384, 382], "positions": [110, 111, 112, 113, 114, 115, 116, 117, 118, 119, 120, 121, 122, 123, 124, 125, 126, 127, 128, 129, 130], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "CCCCCCCCCCCCCCCCWCCCC"}, {"id": "n25", "node_type": "heading", "parent": "n20", "children": ["n26"], "depth": 3, "title": "prune", "path": "quillsync > Commands > prune", "attrs": {"level": 3}, "unit": "u7", "text": "### prune\n\n", "tokens": [14711, 80626, 271], "positions": [131, 132, 133], "seq_ids": [3], "token_class": "MCW"}, {"id": "n26", "node_type": "paragraph", "parent": "n25", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "quillsync 